     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Doubts and nuances",
     "texto": [
      "**Mah** (well), **insomma** (anyway), **forse** (perhaps).",
      "Example: **Mah, non sono sicuro** (well, I'm not sure)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement and disagreement",
     "texto": [
      "**In effetti** (indeed), **Ti do ragione** (I agree with you), **Certo che sì** (of course). To say no: **Macché!** (not at all!), **Figurati!** (no way!), **Per carità!** (absolutely not!).",
      "They are very colloquial forms."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Disbelief",
     "texto": [
      "**Ma dai!** (come on!), **Non ci credo** (I don't believe it).",
      "They show that you don't believe something."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
